---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Container } from "design-system-base";
---

<Layout
  title="AI Disclosure — Metabolic 40+"
  description="How we use AI to create and curate health content for adults over 40."
  type="website"
>
  <Container class="py-16 sm:py-20 max-w-3xl">
    <article class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">AI Disclosure</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Our use of artificial intelligence in content creation</p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">AI-Assisted Content Creation</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Some content on Metabolic 40+ is created with the assistance of artificial intelligence tools. 
            AI is used to help draft, organize, and refine our articles — but all content is reviewed, 
            verified, and approved by our editorial team before publication.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Human Oversight</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Every piece of content created with AI assistance undergoes rigorous human review including:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-2">
            <li>Medical accuracy verification by qualified reviewers</li>
            <li>Source citation validation</li>
            <li>Fact-checking against primary research</li>
            <li>Language and clarity review</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Limitations</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            AI is not perfect. While we strive to provide accurate information, we acknowledge that 
            AI-generated content may occasionally contain inaccuracies or outdated information. 
            If you notice any errors, please contact us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Not Medical Advice</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            AI or human-generated content on this site is not a substitute for professional medical advice. 
            Always consult with a qualified healthcare provider before making significant changes to your 
            diet, exercise, or medication regimen.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </Container>
</Layout>